# ── One-off debugging leftovers ───────────────────────────────────────
# A batch of these was committed to the repo root during past manual
# troubleshooting. Two of them (cleanup.php, full_cleanup.php) dropped the
# articles FULLTEXT index and its generated columns, so keeping that class of
# script out of the repo is a safety measure, not only tidiness.
#
# All patterns are anchored with a leading slash: they apply to the repo root
# only, never to app/, resources/ or tests/.
/*.txt
!/README*.txt
/*.html
/*.log
/versions.json
/add_*.php
/check_*.php
/cleanup.php
/*_cleanup.php
/test.php
/test_compiled.php
